sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client / Inference Gateway
    participant Sidecar as Routing Sidecar<br/>8000/TCP TLS 1.2+
    participant Allowlist as AllowlistValidator<br/>(SSRF Protection)
    participant Prefiller as Remote Prefill Worker<br/>per-request port, HTTP/HTTPS
    participant Decoder as Local vLLM Decoder<br/>default 8001, HTTP/HTTPS

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Client,Decoder: Flow 1: Disaggregated Prefill/Decode (NIXL v2)
        Client->>Sidecar: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Header: x-prefiller-host-port<br/>TLS 1.2+
        Sidecar->>Allowlist: Validate prefill target host
        Allowlist-->>Sidecar: Allowed (host in InferencePool pods)

        rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
            Note over Sidecar,Prefiller: Phase 1: Prefill
            Sidecar->>Prefiller: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>stream=false, max_tokens=1<br/>kv_transfer_params: {do_remote_decode: true}
            Prefiller-->>Sidecar: Response with kv_transfer_params<br/>(KV cache transfer metadata)
        end

        rect rgb(224, 255, 224)
            Note over Sidecar,Decoder: Phase 2: Decode
            Sidecar->>Decoder: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Original request + kv_transfer_params<br/>from prefill response
            Decoder-->>Sidecar: Completion response<br/>(streamed tokens)
        end

        Sidecar-->>Client: Completion response<br/>TLS 1.2+
    end

    rect rgb(245, 245, 245)
        Note over Client,Decoder: Flow 2: Direct Passthrough (no prefill header)
        Client->>Sidecar: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>No x-prefiller-host-port header<br/>TLS 1.2+
        Sidecar->>Decoder: Forward request directly<br/>HTTP or HTTPS
        Decoder-->>Sidecar: Completion response
        Sidecar-->>Client: Completion response<br/>TLS 1.2+
    end
